SQLite database engine
----------------------

The SQLite database engine compiled into modernc.org/sqlite (including the
FTS5 module) is in the public domain. See
https://www.sqlite.org/copyright.html.

The modernc.org/sqlite module additionally contains sqlite-vec sources
(Apache-2.0 OR MIT, Copyright (c) 2024 Alex Garcia) in the `vec` package.
EJQuick does not import that package.

